- app/khoa_dang_nhap_google.py (moi): singleton asyncio trong tien trinh
  loi — serial 1 luot Google tai 1 thoi diem, gian cach 25 giay tu moc
  ket thuc luot truoc (c2a _GLOGIN_GAP_S), giu captcha 6 gio
  (c2a _GLOGIN_CAPTCHA_HOLD_S), chu hold chay lai duoc de go hold.
  Gap doc tu env WEB2API_GOOGLE_GIAN_CACH_GIAY luc goi (mac dinh 25).
- 4 module *-web: tai_dung_ho_so thanh wrapper qua khoa loi (chi serial
  neu khong danh tinh, khong dat hold); hook captcha-subset o moi diem
  kiem tin hieu trong than cu (_tai_dung_ho_so_chay); thanh cong go hold
  cua dung chu; T2 + dang_nhap nhanh google noi chu_giu=email (bo sung
  tren main 5c86930: patch cu chua noi dang_nhap, chu hold lech voi T2).
- test/conftest.py: gap Google = 0 trong test.
- test/test_nv309_c.py (moi, 7 test): serial, gap, captcha chan module
  khac bang cho_captcha_toan_cuc, chu hold chay lai go hold, 2FA thuan
  khong dat hold, luot khong danh tinh chi serial, dang_nhap google
  dat hold theo email.
